This module redistributes a binary-patched copy of `classes.dex` from:

  TEESimulator-RS — https://github.com/Enginex0/TEESimulator-RS
  Copyright (C) Enginex0, licensed under GPL-3.0
  (itself a fork of JingMatrix/TEESimulator —
   https://github.com/JingMatrix/TEESimulator)

The only change is a 2-byte edit to
KeyMintSecurityLevelInterceptor.trackAndEnforceOpLimit that makes the
StrongBox concurrent-operation limit check always pass (lifting the
hardcoded cap of 4). The exact transformation is documented in README.md
and reproducible with tools/patch_dex.py. Corresponding source for
TEESimulator-RS is available at the URL above.
